      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "QUICK AUSSIE (7) was safely held last time out, finishing sixth at Geelong over 400m behind Aston Monsoon (23.66) in a Grade 5. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Should be very hard to beat this time. ASTON FLAMENCO (2) doesn't have the best strike-rate but recent form is sound. Has been in the money the last three starts, the latest when second (22.72) at this track. Form here sound including two wins. Expected to be in this for a long way. LITTLE DARL (1) has missed the frame at her last couple but wasn't beaten far three back when second (24.44) at Bendigo in a Grade 5. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. ENERGISER DASH (3) has been in the placings at her last two runs, most recently when third (24.88) in a Grade 5 over 425m at Bendigo.",
